{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"746939431696728086","content":"\"How Krumpel Stole Yule.\"\nA Dnd one shot.\n\nYou will be playing as the children of Mrs. Dickens Orphanage and Iron mine. But you will not be playing the character you write. The character you write will be put into a pile and distributed at random to the other players. \n\nCreation rules. \nAny Wotc or Arcanian races and classes are welcome. Level 7. Stats: Roll 4 die keep the lowest 3.  Items: One Rare, One Very rare with two detrimental properties that can either be on one item or split between the two. Get creative with the flaws. \n\nKrumpel the Beholder has stolen christmas from the orphans. It's time for revenge.","created_at":"2020-12-20T19:51:59.302000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"790305520702980098","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
